hort, and straight to the game mechanism. No more visual novel thing.Duel tutorial becomes a lot easier to understand, helpful, and more hand-holding.Added Deckbuilding tutorial.Casual Mode Crystals are reduced to 2500Some card cost and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T10:48:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494410","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1840310314352861","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | Demo v5","summary":"Hi, supernatural fans and duelists.The new of DEMO is here! (V5)Dramatically improved HUD and UI throughout the game.New roguelite buff called \"Omen\" system that will enhance your deck in surprising ways.FYI : For press kit... please visit https://www.blightsilver.comChange LogNew UI : Both Battle HUD and other UI has been overhauled. It's a totally different game from v3. I can say it.Omen System : A roguelite buff. Each time you win a battle, you will be granted an omen. Pick 1 out of 3. Multi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T00:52:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1838407329258416","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Press Kit / Image Asset","summary":"Hi,For our friends who are making videos or channel about Blightsilver, we have a 4k definitions image assets and video. Both vertical and horizontal. Please download via our website https://www.blightsilver.com/It's a website for image/video storage only, so don't surprise with a mess inside it. ːsteamfacepalmːAnyway, here are some 4k asset... But we do encourage to find more inside our website.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T03:50:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329258416","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1838407329255446","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | Demo v3","summary":"Hi, supernatural fans and duelists.The final version of DEMO is here! (V3)We have turned Blightsilver into a real detective game. Not just find-key-and-play-minigame-to-solve-puzzle.In demo v3 ... we've introduced.... A detective log, where player can drag and drop their pieces of clue they found and form their own verdict. Change Log- Added Detective Log- Added Investigation Tools : Thermometer, Polaroid Camera, EMF Meter, Translator- Added choices in visual novel- Dialogues has changed slightl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T01:12:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329255446","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1836506165569077","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | Demo v2","summary":"Hi supernatural fans and duelists,Demo V2 is here!This will change the game play flow significantly and more friendly to players who are card game lovers.Change Log- Quick Duel Mode : Duel instantly (with optional tutorial) with random pools of Easy/Normal/Hard opponents. Gain rewards without having to go mining in Exploration mode.- Protagonist Selection : In the future, we will allow switching between each protagonists in Exploration Mode. But for now, on this demo, we've experimentally allow ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T21:33:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165569077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1836506165556154","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | More More Duel","summary":"Hi supernatural fans and duelists,Many of you have played the demo and gave us feed backs, thank you so much! ːsteamhappyːMost of our fans loves card games more than visual novels. So we have re-weighted our direction to lean more to the card game side on both system-wise and story-wise. We are also adding a new \"Quick Duel\" feature to the demo soon. This will allow player to duel & progress difficulty without having to linger too long in the explorations!We are going to update our key art (also","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T09:51:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1835236783566904","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | Demo is Ready!!","summary":"Hi supernatural fans and duelists,The playable Demo is now available!!Tap on the green Demo button to navigate to demo download pageIf you still couldn't see the Demo button, try out this page -> Demo PageFirst of all before visiting the haunted world... Please don't forget to wishlist !! ːsteamhappyːThe flow of the demo would be Visual Novel -> Exploration (Navigate / Duel / Puzzles / Treasure Hunts) -> BossThere would still be bugs (mostly card bugs). We are actively fixing them. But overall f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T00:49:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783566904","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4786130-1834602721188120","game_id":"steam-4786130","kind":"announcement","title":"Blightsilver | Explore Liminal Spaces!!","summary":"Hi supernatural fans and duelists,We are proud to announce our new feature : \"Exploration\"Instead of just a plain visual novel, we are going to let players wander through haunted / abandoned / goosebump / liminal locations through out the city. Each chapter will have at least one exploration. And we are planned to add more optional sub-quest exploration if it fits the game well. Within each explorable location, players might find puzzles, lores, creepy stuffs, and of course, ghost busting using ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T16:39:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4786130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4786130":"2026-10-26T14:09:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4786130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:15Z"},"4850900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4786130","app_id":4786130,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:57Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},